		{"id":"recovery-paths","type":"text","text":"## Recovery Paths\n\n1. **Retry** - Attempt same action again\n2. **Navigate Away** - Go to safe screen\n3. **Re-authenticate** - Login again\n4. **Contact Support** - Get human help\n5. **Offline Mode** - Limited functionality","x":900,"y":1600,"width":400,"height":200,"color":"5"}
